sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Server
    participant R as Redis (Cache)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant E as Embedding Provider

    C->>A: POST /search {query, topK, context}
    A->>A: Validate JWT + enforce team/repo access
    A->>R: Check cache (full request + auth key)
    alt Cache hit
        R-->>A: Cached response
        A-->>C: 200 {results, cached: true}
    else Cache miss
        par Signal 1: Semantic
            A->>E: Embed query (768d)
            E-->>A: Query vector
            A->>PG: ANN search (pgvector <=>)
        and Signal 2: Keyword
            A->>PG: ts_rank full-text search
        and Signal 3: Entity
            A->>PG: Fact entity overlap
        and Signal 4: Graph
            A->>PG: Graph neighbor traversal
        end
        A->>A: RRF fusion (4 signals)
        A->>A: Composite ranking<br/>(temporal decay 30d, usage, graph, quality, repo, confidence)
        A->>A: Diversity + token budget packing
        A->>R: Cache response (5 min TTL)
        A-->>C: 200 {results, latencyMs, totalCount}
    end

    Note over C,A: Feedback loop
    C->>A: POST /feedback {resultId, score}
    A->>PG: Update chunk quality / fact confidence
    A->>A: Adjust adaptive signal weights
